# Li2CO3 PHREEQC/Pitzer extension for the Rezaee pretreated liquor basis.
# Insert this block before the first END in embedded pitzer.dat before loading it
# with Reaktoro PhreeqcDatabase.fromContents(...).
#
# Provenance:
# - Li+-CO3-2 Pitzer beta/Cphi parameters and Na/Li/Cl/CO3 theta/psi
#   values are from Cheng, Li, and Cheng (2013), J. Chem. Thermodynamics
#   67, 74-82, DOI: 10.1016/j.jct.2013.07.024.
# - The phase log_k is a 25 C screening value derived from Cheng et al.
#   pure-water Li2CO3 solubility. It is retained with the published
#   dissolution enthalpy reported by Ge, Wang, and Wang (2025), Molecules
#   30, 3617, DOI: 10.3390/molecules30173617.
# - Ge et al. (2025) supplies the Na2CO3-NaCl mother-liquor solubility
#   rows used for the generated first-payload chemistry table.

PHASES
Li2CO3
    Li2CO3 = 2 Li+ + CO3-2
    log_k -1.680
    delta_h -4.3 kJ

PITZER
-B0
    Li+    CO3-2    0.421037    2.642263    0    -0.00868
-B1
    Li+    CO3-2   -0.78283    51.96328    0    -0.19517
-C0
    Li+    CO3-2   -0.10123    0    0    0
-THETA
    Na+    Li+      0.02016
    Cl-    CO3-2   -0.02
-PSI
    Na+    Li+    Cl-      -0.007416
    Na+    Li+    CO3-2    0.202563
    Cl-    CO3-2  Na+      0.03
    Cl-    CO3-2  Li+      0.135066
